<title>HUNGARY: Hungary Jan-Feb retail/catering down 12 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Hungary Jan-Feb retail/catering down 12 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's retail and catering turnover dropped 12 percent in the January-February period compared with a year earlier, the Central Statistical Office (KSH) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Hungary's retail and catering turnover totalled 386 billion forints in the first two months of the year, five percent up in nominal terms from the same period of 1996.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
